@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:一跑进淋浴房——<br>就看到艾玛呆呆地站在原地。|#0202Adv15_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:75 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛！|#0202Adv15_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……希罗。|#0202Adv15_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 木の扉が閉じる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_144 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:淋浴房的门在我身后关上了。|#0202Adv15_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:冰冷的氛围笼罩着我和艾玛。|#0202Adv15_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……可可在哪？|#0202Adv15_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……你在说什么？|#0202Adv15_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我从她的脸上看不出任何感情，<br>便快速扫视了一圈淋浴房。|#0202Adv15_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可不在。|#0202Adv15_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（怎么回事！？）|#0202Adv15_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

; 天気が悪いので夜差分使用してもよさそう

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} TintColor:#8888BB Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:9_1
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_144 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:0.2

@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:我感到大脑一片混乱，<br>急忙走出淋浴房。|#0202Adv15_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但我不知该去哪，<br>只能先边走边思考。|#0202Adv15_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（这不对。可可去哪了？<br>　她刚才不是在淋浴房直播吗）|#0202Adv15_Hiro004|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（很明显她被枪击了）|#0202Adv15_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（那尸体究竟去哪里了……！<br>　如果被搬到了别处……那难道是）|#0202Adv15_Hiro006|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……焚烧炉吗！）|#0202Adv15_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_126 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:想到的一瞬间，<br>我立马冲了过去。|#0202Adv15_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（焚烧炉在地下……！<br>　现在应该还来得及……！）|#0202Adv15_Hiro008|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:距离15时焚烧炉自动启动<br>还有一点时间。|#0202Adv15_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} TintColor:#FFFFFF Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:5_1

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9
@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:3

[PrintTextModified Text:就在我冲进<br>会客厅的那一刻。|#0202Adv15_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 雷音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_131 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

; ＠備考◆驚く

[PrintTextModified Text:——！|#0202Adv15_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:一阵无比巨大的轰鸣声响起，<br>惊得我停下了脚步。|#0202Adv15_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 激しい雨音
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Ambi_8_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:我这才想起，汉娜先前说过。<br>现在在下雨。|#0202Adv15_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我实在是太着急了，<br>直到现在才注意到嘈杂的雨声。|#0202Adv15_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1,Angle01/Option_Arms-

[PrintTextModified Text:刚才那个声音好大啊……！|#0202Adv15_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是不是有雷劈在附近了。|#0202Adv15_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:会客厅里是蕾雅和安安。|#0202Adv15_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:说起来，<br>刚才在去淋浴房的路上也看到了她们。|#0202Adv15_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:下一秒。<br>就在这激烈的雨声与雷声交织的间隙——|#0202Adv15_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

; 遠くから聞こえる
; ＠備考◆悲鳴を呑みこむ

[PrintTextModified Text:噫……啊啊啊……！|#0202Adv15_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:传来一声抽搐着的凄惨尖叫。|#0202Adv15_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这声音，是艾玛……？）|#0202Adv15_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我转身看向走廊。|#0202Adv15_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:走廊有扇通往中庭的门。<br>而门是开着的。|#0202Adv15_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但我刚刚经过那里时，<br>门应该是关着的。|#0202Adv15_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……是艾玛开的吗？）|#0202Adv15_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:刚才的雷击和嘈杂的雨声，<br>都仿佛是一种凶兆。|#0202Adv15_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:自打看了可可的直播，<br>我的心跳就一直吵得不行。|#0202Adv15_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:像是被一股力量吸引过去似的，<br>我独自迈着摇摇晃晃的步子走向中庭。|#0202Adv15_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后——|#0202Adv15_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那倾盆大雨似乎只是阵雨。|#0202Adv15_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在下着小雨的中庭——|#0202Adv15_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

