[PrintTextModified Text:毒舌主播少女泽渡可可，<br>正仰面倒在地上。|#0202Adv15_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她双眼瞪得巨大，<br>脸上写满惊恐。|#0202Adv15_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:尽管拥有【千里眼】魔法，<br>这双眼却再也看不到任何东西了。|#0202Adv15_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可已经完全停止了生命活动。|#0202Adv15_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:成群聚集在她头部飞舞的赤蝶，<br>似乎昭示着她是被射穿额头而当场死亡的。|#0202Adv15_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可……！！|#0202Adv15_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我急忙想跑过去，<br>却突然发现。|#0202Adv15_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛正站在可可的尸体前。|#0202Adv15_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她视线涣散，眼里毫无感情，<br>俯视着可可。|#0202Adv15_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——手里还拿着把枪。|#0202Adv15_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} TintColor:#8888BB Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:28_1

@HideActors ActorIds:Stills Lazy:false

@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:是你……向可可开枪的吗？|#0202Adv15_Hiro013| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Fearful1

[PrintTextModified Text:听见我的问话，<br>艾玛仿佛才回过神来，回头看向我。|#0202Adv15_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗？<br>……不是的，我怎么会——|#0202Adv15_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:75 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:那这把手枪是怎么回事？|#0202Adv15_Hiro014| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这是……我看掉在地上就捡了起来。|#0202Adv15_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的辩解<br>让我心生怀疑，便眯起眼睛问她。|#0202Adv15_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:真的是这样吗。|#0202Adv15_Hiro015| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……什么意思？|#0202Adv15_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

