[PrintTextModified Text:我感觉心情极差，<br>正准备离开房间。|#0202Adv15_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended TintColor:#808040 Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0202Adv15_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我用余光瞥见艾玛似乎发现了什么东西，<br>一下子藏到怀里。|#0202Adv15_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（她藏了什么……？）|#0202Adv15_Hiro016| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

