; ========================================
; 回想ここまで
; ========================================

@ModifyCharacterExtended TintColor:#FFFFFF Lazy:false ScenePosition:25 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Fearful1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:75 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:在整理玛格遗物的时候，<br>你是不是偷偷藏了什么东西？|#0202Adv15_Hiro017| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……！|#0202Adv15_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:到底是什么？<br>该不会是手枪吧？|#0202Adv15_Hiro018| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended TintColor:#FFFFFF Lazy:false ScenePosition:25 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:那是——|#0202Adv15_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你就是用这把枪杀死了可可，<br>把她从垃圾滑槽<br>扔进了焚烧炉吧？|#0202Adv15_Hiro019| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我没给她反驳的余地，<br>连珠炮似的逼问道。|#0202Adv15_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0202Adv15_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的眼神动摇了一下。|#0202Adv15_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:本以为她要哭出来了——<br>……没想到艾玛正用阴暗的眼神瞪着我。|#0202Adv15_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:你说够了吗。|#0202Adv15_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗，<br>你就那么想诬赖我是凶手吗……？|#0202Adv15_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这和我怎么想没关系。<br>而是所有的情况都在指明，你就是凶手。|#0202Adv15_Hiro020| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……我问你，希罗。|#0202Adv15_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你把我叫到淋浴房，是陷阱？<br>这一切都是你为了诬陷我设下的局……？<br>|#0202Adv15_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不知为何，我感到有股看不见摸不着的凉意<br>顺着背爬了上来，让我为之一抖。|#0202Adv15_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我就知道，艾玛的本性果然——）|#0202Adv15_Hiro021| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:凶手难道不是希罗你吗？|#0202Adv15_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

