@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40,,1 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，艾玛，希罗！<br>你们在这啊！<br>我刚才好像看到了超级可怕的——|#0202Adv15_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:呼哧，呼哧，为什么要把我也拖过来……|#0202Adv15_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉和汉娜也来到了中庭。<br>看起来是雪莉硬拉汉娜过来的。<br>|#0202Adv15_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:随后，她们立即注意到了眼前的场面。<br>|#0202Adv15_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这是……|#0202Adv15_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Fearful1

[PrintTextModified Text:呀啊啊啊啊啊！？|#0202Adv15_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一看到可可的尸体汉娜就大声尖叫起来，<br>情不自禁地抓住雪莉。<br>|#0202Adv15_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，那个手枪是……？|#0202Adv15_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:眼尖的雪莉立即询问起艾玛手里的手枪。<br>|#0202Adv15_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:不、不是的！<br>我只是把掉在地上的枪捡了起来！|#0202Adv15_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:75 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:谁知道呢？|#0202Adv15_Hiro022| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0202Adv15_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

