[PrintTextModified Text:就在此时，手机提示音响了起来。<br>大概是典狱长发来的通知吧。|#0202Adv15_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:劝你还是在投票开始前，<br>想个更有说服力的借口吧。|#0202Adv15_Hiro023| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:真相会在审判中揭晓。|#0202Adv15_Hiro024| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

